**Date:** ${timestamp}

**Subjective:**
${soapNote.subjective || 'N/A'}

**Objective:**
${soapNote.objective || 'N/A'}

**Assessment:**
${soapNote.assessment || 'N/A'}

**Plan:**
${soapNote.plan || 'N/A'}
        `.trim();

